UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>Among the boats working this stretch of river, the one we reach for when a guest wants the bank visible from the bed is a <a href="/hotel/5-star-nile-cruise">5 star Nile cruise</a> with floor to ceiling windows in every cabin category rather than portholes.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'best-luxury-nile-cruise-egypt';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>The river leg is the part of this route where the choice of boat changes the week, and a <a href="/hotel/5-star-nile-cruise">5 star Nile cruise</a> departing Aswan on Mondays or Luxor on Thursdays fits either direction without bending the rest of the plan.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'luxury-cairo-luxor-aswan-itinerary';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>Where a journey includes the stretch between Luxor and Aswan we more often use a small ship such as <a href="/hotel/5-star-nile-cruise">MS Le Fayan</a> than one of the larger river vessels, because the temples at Esna, Edfu and Kom Ombo sit close enough to the water that the boat is genuinely the transport.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'luxury-egypt-tours';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>Departures run to a fixed weekly pattern in both directions, which makes a <a href="/hotel/5-star-nile-cruise">5 star Nile cruise</a> one of the easier fixed points to build a tailored itinerary around.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'tailor-made-egypt-tours';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>The months that suit a sailing are narrower than the months that suit Egypt generally, and the sundeck of a <a href="/hotel/5-star-nile-cruise">5 star Nile cruise</a> is usable for most of the day only between October and April.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'best-time-to-visit-egypt';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Sailings north toward Luxor leave from this town, so guests staying here often join <a href="/hotel/5-star-nile-cruise">MS Le Fayan</a> on its Monday departure rather than flying on.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'old-cataract-aswan';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>The Luxor nights on this route are the ones where the address decides how early the mornings can start, and the <a href="/hotel/old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel">Old Winter Palace Luxor hotel</a> sits on the east bank corniche within walking distance of Luxor Temple.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'luxury-cairo-luxor-aswan-itinerary';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>Almost every sailing begins or ends in Luxor, and the <a href="/hotel/old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel">Old Winter Palace Luxor hotel</a> is where the land nights on that side of the river usually go.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'best-luxury-nile-cruise-egypt';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>Luxor is the one city where the hotel changes the itinerary rather than only the comfort, and at the <a href="/hotel/old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel">Old Winter Palace Luxor hotel</a> the wing you book matters more than the room category.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'planning-a-trip-to-egypt';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>The Victorian river palaces are a distinct kind of stay in Egypt, and <a href="/hotel/old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel">Sofitel Winter Palace Luxor</a> is the one on the east bank facing the Theban necropolis across the water.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'luxury-egypt-tours';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>October to April is the working season in Luxor, and it is also when the royal gardens behind <a href="/hotel/old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel">Sofitel Winter Palace Luxor</a> are usable through the closed middle of the day.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'best-time-to-visit-egypt';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Travellers doing the classic route generally stay in both of Egypt's Victorian river palaces, and the <a href="/hotel/old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel">Old Winter Palace Luxor hotel</a> is the Luxor half of that pair.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'old-cataract-aswan';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Guests who choose a historic hotel in Giza tend to want the same in Luxor, which is the <a href="/hotel/old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel">Old Winter Palace Luxor hotel</a> on the east bank corniche.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'mena-house-hotel-egypt';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>Couples finishing a temples itinerary often add three nights at the <a href="/hotel/oberoi-sahl-hasheesh">Oberoi Sahl Hasheesh</a>, where every suite has a private courtyard or garden of its own and some have private pools.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'egypt-honeymoon';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>The last three nights are the part of a tailored itinerary most often got wrong, and an all suite Red Sea property such as <a href="/hotel/oberoi-sahl-hasheesh">The Oberoi at Sahl Hasheesh</a> is the usual correction.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'tailor-made-egypt-tours';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>If the trip runs eight days or more, three nights at the <a href="/hotel/oberoi-sahl-hasheesh">Oberoi Sahl Hasheesh</a> are worth more than another site, because the classic route through Cairo, Luxor and Aswan is dense and starts early every morning.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'planning-a-trip-to-egypt';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>The Red Sea season is longer than the Nile Valley season, which is why a stay at the <a href="/hotel/oberoi-sahl-hasheesh">Oberoi Sahl Hasheesh</a> still works in the months that are already too hot for Luxor.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'egypt-travel-tips';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>A trip that finishes on the coast needs swimwear alongside the covered clothing the temples ask for, particularly at <a href="/hotel/oberoi-sahl-hasheesh">The Oberoi at Sahl Hasheesh</a>, where the private beach is the centre of the stay.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'what-to-pack-for-egypt';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Guests who begin a trip here frequently end it on the coast, and the <a href="/hotel/oberoi-sahl-hasheesh">Oberoi Sahl Hasheesh</a> is the all suite property we use south of Hurghada for that.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'four-seasons-nile-plaza';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>A Cairo start and a Red Sea finish is the shape most long Egypt itineraries settle into, and the second half of that usually lands at the <a href="/hotel/oberoi-sahl-hasheesh">Oberoi Sahl Hasheesh</a>.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'fairmont-nile-city';
UPDATE posts SET body_en = body_en || $L$<p>Alexandria is normally attempted as a day trip from the capital, which leaves about four usable hours after the drive each way, and a night at the <a href="/hotel/four-seasons-hotel-alexandria-egypt">Four Seasons Hotel Alexandria</a> buys back the evening along the corniche that a day tripper always misses.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'private-tours-in-cairo-egypt';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Guests who want the same brand on the Mediterranean will find the <a href="/hotel/four-seasons-hotel-alexandria-egypt">Four Seasons Hotel Alexandria</a> doing an entirely different job, as a pause rather than as a base for a dense city.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'four-seasons-nile-plaza';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>The other property of this brand worth knowing about in Egypt sits on the coast, where the <a href="/hotel/four-seasons-hotel-alexandria-egypt">Four Seasons Hotel Alexandria at San Stefano</a> has a private beach and rooms facing north over the sea.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'four-seasons-first-residence-cairo';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Alexandria sits at the far end of the desert road from here, and the <a href="/hotel/four-seasons-hotel-alexandria-egypt">Four Seasons Hotel Alexandria</a> is the seafront base that makes an overnight worth more than a day trip.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'cairo-marriott-hotel';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Guests adding the Mediterranean coast to a Cairo stay usually do it from the <a href="/hotel/four-seasons-hotel-alexandria-egypt">Four Seasons Hotel Alexandria</a> at San Stefano, a short drive from the Bibliotheca Alexandrina and Qaitbay Citadel.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'sofitel-cairo-nile-el-gezirah';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>The second city is a different proposition from this one, and two nights at the <a href="/hotel/four-seasons-hotel-alexandria-egypt">Four Seasons Hotel Alexandria</a> is the shortest stay that makes the journey north worthwhile.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'kempinski-nile-hotel-cairo';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>For guests continuing to the coast rather than to the Nile, the <a href="/hotel/four-seasons-hotel-alexandria-egypt">Four Seasons Hotel Alexandria at San Stefano</a> is the seafront property we use in the second city.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'waldorf-astoria-cairo-heliopolis';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Most guests give the river a few nights on land at either end, which is where the <a href="/blog/luxury-cairo-luxor-aswan-itinerary">Cairo, Luxor and Aswan itinerary</a>, the wider <a href="/blog/best-luxury-nile-cruise-egypt">comparison of Nile cruise boats</a> and the <a href="/hotel/old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel">Old Winter Palace Luxor hotel</a> all come in.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = '5-star-nile-cruise';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>The Luxor nights usually sit either side of a sailing, so the <a href="/blog/luxury-cairo-luxor-aswan-itinerary">Cairo, Luxor and Aswan itinerary</a> and the <a href="/hotel/5-star-nile-cruise">5 star Nile cruise</a> that departs from here on Thursdays are the two pages to read next.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'old-winter-palace-luxor-hotel';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>The beach nights only make sense against what comes before them, so the <a href="/blog/best-luxury-nile-cruise-egypt">comparison of Nile cruise boats</a> and the <a href="/hotel/5-star-nile-cruise">5 star Nile cruise</a> we use between Luxor and Aswan are the pages that decide whether three nights here have been earned.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'oberoi-sahl-hasheesh';
UPDATE hotels SET article = article || $L$<p>Alexandria works best as the pause between the capital and the river, so the <a href="/blog/private-tours-in-cairo-egypt">three days Cairo actually needs</a> and the <a href="/hotel/four-seasons-nile-plaza">Four Seasons Nile Plaza</a> are the two pages to set against it.</p>$L$, updated_at = now() WHERE slug = 'four-seasons-hotel-alexandria-egypt';
